Derivative files
----------------

Two files here are derivative works of upstream code, both Apache-2.0 at the
source. The rest of the repository is original to this project.

sm70_kernels/longctx_decode/csrc/sm70_longctx_decode.cu
  Derived from python/sglang/kernels/jit/csrc/sm70_longctx_decode.cu in
  dg1kjd/sglang-sxm2 at 73abfe1dd7e7aae7a62b222a201e48f532fb298e.

  Ours: the E5M2 byte-KV path and the fp16 path; two uninitialised reads fixed
  in the split combine (probs[] lanes past tile_tokens, empty trailing splits
  returning before writing o/lse); HFMA2 QK accumulation; per-tile half2 PV
  accumulation folded into fp32 once per tile.

sm70_kernels/tilelang_fa/_kernels_paged.py
  Derived from python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/tilelang_fa_v100/_kernels_paged.py
  in dg1kjd/sglang-sxm2 at the same commit, itself vendored from
  haohervchb/GooseLLM 3rdparty/tilelang-fa-v100.

  Ours: the per-iteration T.clear of the K/V shared tiles hoisted out of the
  loop; the PV gemm reading P_shared directly; softmax through exp2; and the
  dim-256 tile holding Q in a fragment so block_N=64 fits.

Everything else is ours: the extension build and load path, the package
initialisers, tests, benchmarks, docs, packaging and PROVENANCE.md. The file
list and the change lists above are those in PROVENANCE.md.

